{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:37 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-28 HKT</p><p>今日（28日）傍晚近6時，大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警，冒出陣陣濃煙，多名途人報警求助，屋主亦及時離開單位。消防到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，迅速將火救熄，事件中無人受傷，毋須疏散。</p><p>據了解，上址由一對情侶所租住，起火原因疑煙頭燒着床單引起火警。</p><img alt=\"女戶主沒有受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f23246d8cc92b6d3305f56de3f847e2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_19_02_18.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火救熄。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8802a8cd92c7654ac01101876ed2a63c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_19_00_37.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火救熄。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45a1faf39e29435100f9eab009d68488/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_19_00_36_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為大埔頭水圍村一村屋。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f49270a93fdcf39a48fdd52cd17a80d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_19_00_48.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火救熄。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4818c16bb660c4e69e3b831bafcbc69/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-28_at_19_00_47.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警。dengjunrong@Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/478bad16e4328e4fae77b26b1e349848/2026-11/931796834_17969962461213237_2088732613757615021_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警。dengjunrong@Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f127e43950db2ce2b50e275bb10644c/2026-11/935110923_17969962449213237_6232823295444256128_n.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:38:07.531781+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:37:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:51:53.511038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:31:39.422357+00:00","content_hash":"e295a977f68b82d3d195c4a3762bc0f3aba855dfda170828db6c75085c6afe9e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_captur